# Puff Note Context

Puff Note is a mobile first web prototype.

Flow:
Landing page → pick mood → start capture → open phone video camera → draw trace with finger on camera view → capture frame → apply mood finish → save as image/poster.

MVP decision:
Use touch drawing over the live camera view.
Do not implement MediaPipe or air gesture tracking unless explicitly asked.

Visual direction:
Japanese editorial minimalism, soft cloud atmosphere, 217 Atelier taste, tactile mochi bubble buttons.

Avoid:
SaaS look, ecommerce language, air purifier ad feeling, childish kawaii, busy scrapbook, generic wellness app.

Prioritize:
Working flow, beautiful mood bubbles, reliable mobile camera, clear poster export.